="11"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">1</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">teaspoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">Zest of a lemon</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="12"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">2</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">tablespoons</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">extra virgin olive oil</span></li></ul></div><div class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-group"><h4 class="wprm-recipe-group-name wprm-recipe-ingredient-group-name wprm-block-text-bold">As Garnish</h4><ul class="wprm-recipe-ingredients"><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="14"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">2</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">tablespoons</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">honey</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="15"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">2</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">tablespoons</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">pistachios</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">roughly chopped</span></li><li class="wprm-recipe-ingredient" style="list-style-type: disc;" data-uid="16"><span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-amount">1</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-unit">tablespoon</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-name">fresh parsley</span> <span class="wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes wprm-recipe-ingredient-notes-faded">chopped</span></li></ul></div><div class="wprm-unit-conversion-container wprm-unit-conversion-container-83662 wprm-unit-conversion-container-links wprm-block-text-normal" style=""><a href="#" role="button" class="wprm-unit-conversion wprmpuc-active" data-system="1" data-recipe="83662" style="" aria-label="Change unit system to US Customary">US Customary</a> &ndash; <a href="#" role="button" class="wprm-unit-conversion" data-system="2" data-recipe="83662" style="" aria-label="Change unit system to Metric">Metric</a></div></div>
<div id="recipe-83662-instructions" class="wprm-recipe-instructions-container wprm-recipe-83662-instructions-container wprm-block-text-normal" data-recipe="83662"><h3 class="wprm-recipe-header wprm-recipe-instructions-header wprm-block-text-bold wprm-align-left wprm-header-decoration-none" style="">Instructions</h3><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-group"><ul class="wprm-recipe-instructions"><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-0" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Preheat the oven to 400&deg;F (204&deg;C). Line a baking sheet with parchment paper and set aside.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-1" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">In a large bowl, whisk together olive oil, harissa, honey, and lemon zest. Taste for seasoning and season with salt if necessary.</div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Person making harissa sauce and spreading carrots with the sauce." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-2" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Add the carrots to the prepared sheet pan and spread the harissa mixture evenly, ensuring the carrots are fully coated with the mixture. Spread them on a single layer.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-3" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Roast for 30-35 minutes, flipping them halfway through to ensure even roasting.</span></div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-4" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Remove from the oven and let them cool down for 10 minutes.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Roasted-carrots-with-harissa-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Side by side photos showing the roasted carrots and whipped feta." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Roasted-carrots-with-harissa-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Roasted-carrots-with-harissa-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Roasted-carrots-with-harissa-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Roasted-carrots-with-harissa.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Roasted-carrots-with-harissa.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-5" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">While carrots are roasting, make the whipped feta. Break the feta into large chunks and place it in the bowl of a food processor fitted with the metal blade, along with Greek yogurt and lemon zest.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-6" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;">Pulse a few times to mix, and then turn the machine on and drizzle the olive oil over the tube. Let it run for 40-45 seconds, stopping once or twice to scrape the sides of the bowl to ensure even mixing.</div></li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-7" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Grab a large serving plate, spread the bottom with whipped feta cheese, and then transfer the now-slightly cooled harissa carrots on top.</span></div><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-media wprm-recipe-instruction-image"><img decoding="async" width="400" height="248" src="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-with-whipped-feta-1-400x248.jpg" class="attachment-medium size-medium" alt="Photos showing the assembly of the dish." srcset="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-with-whipped-feta-1-400x248.jpg 400w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-with-whipped-feta-1-768x476.jpg 768w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-with-whipped-feta-1-150x93.jpg 150w, https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-with-whipped-feta-1.jpg 1200w" sizes="(max-width: 400px) 100vw, 400px" data-pin-media="https://foolproofliving.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/09/Honey-harissa-carrots-with-whipped-feta-1.jpg"></div> </li><li id="wprm-recipe-83662-step-0-8" class="wprm-recipe-instruction" style="list-style-type: decimal;"><div class="wprm-recipe-instruction-text" style="margin-bottom: 5px;"><span style="display: block;">Drizzle with 1-2 tablespoons of honey and garnish with pistachios and parsley.</span></div></li></ul></div></div>
